<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Mod id="1f0a153b-26ae-4496-a2c0-a106d9b43c95" version="25">
  <Properties>
    <Name>UI - Promotion Tree for VP</Name>
    <Teaser>Promotion trees and unit statistics for Vox Populi</Teaser>
    <Description>Displays promotion trees for owned units and database-derived combat classes and variants. Includes unit statistics with live promotion hover previews and related-promotion highlighting.

Expanded edition -Alpakinator - vibe-coded with GPT-6.1 Sol:
Adaptable Tree planning alorithm, UI, reactivity, unit stats, better icons, tree and sidebar presentation, path highlighting, performance, and code readability.

Requires Community Patch and Vox Populi. Opens from the Additional Information menu.

Layout derived from http://gaming.stackexchange.com/questions/15846/123</Description>
    <Authors>William Howard (Updated for EUI by Amir Kamal; Enhancement update for VP by UndeadDevel)</Authors>
    <SpecialThanks>Translation: Russian - Tomahawk.nsk</SpecialThanks>
    <HideSetupGame>0</HideSetupGame>
    <Homepage>https://forums.civfanatics.com/threads/community-patch-how-to-install.528034/</Homepage>
